   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I have the following dataset &quot;vc&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>&gt; vc</div><div>         date gross corrected</div><div>13 2017-01-01  3.23      1.98</div><div>14 2017-02-01 -4.22     -1.62</div><div>15 2017-03-01 -1.14     -1.27</div><div>16 2017-04-01  1.83      1.10</div><div>17 2017-05-01  0.57      0.23</div><div>18 2017-06-01  6.09     -0.47</div><div>19 2017-07-01 -2.67      0.28</div><div>20 2017-08-01  4.68      1.92</div><div>21 2017-09-01 -8.66     -0.20</div><div>22 2017-10-01  1.69     -1.11</div><div>23 2017-11-01  1.77      0.42</div><div>24 2017-12-01  0.70      0.85</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">p </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    scale_x_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">limits</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2016-12-31&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2018-01-01&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    date_labels </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;%m/%y&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">date_minor_breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1 month&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    scale_y_continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    xlab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    ylab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Short-term changes (%)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">panel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_rect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grey90&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> axis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ticks </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              panel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">major </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> linetype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;solid&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grey95&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    panel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">minor </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> linetype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;solid&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                colour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grey95&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_hline</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">yintercept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;brown&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> linetype</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;solid&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gross</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Gross&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">corrected</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Corrected&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">16</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    scale_colour_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> breaks</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Gross&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Corrected&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>        values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Gross&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;blue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Corrected&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> face </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bold&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>        legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> face </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bold&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br>ggsave</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test.pdf&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">device</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pdf&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">18</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">units</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cm&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>This code produces the  attached result.</div><div><br></div><div>The colors in the legend are correct but the shape aren&#39;t. How can I have a blue &quot;+&quot;  and a red point in the legend?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><div>Vittorio</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "GNMsFBlCBQAJ",
   "from": "Crump, Ron",
   "author": "942ffec526d6a312",
   "date": "2018-03-26T08:45:02Z",
   "subject": "Re: geom_point() symbols in the legend",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Vittorio,\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "\r<br>&gt; I have the following dataset &quot;vc&quot;\r<br>\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "For future reference it would be easier if the data were supplied as the\r<br>output from dput(vc), as this makes it easier to cut and paste while\r<br>ensuring we have the same data as you do (eg in terms of factors v\r<br>character strings etc).\r<br>\r<br># eg\r<br>\r<br>vc &lt;- structure(list(date = structure(c(17167, 17198, 17226, 17257,\r<br>17287, 17318, 17348, 17379, 17410, 17440, 17471, 17501), class = &quot;Date&quot;),\r<br>     gross = c(3.23, -4.22, -1.14, 1.83, 0.57, 6.09, -2.67, 4.68,\r<br>     -8.66, 1.69, 1.77, 0.7), corrected = c(1.98, -1.62, -1.27,\r<br>     1.1, 0.23, -0.47, 0.28, 1.92, -0.2, -1.11, 0.42, 0.85)), .Names = \r<br>c(&quot;date&quot;,\r<br>&quot;gross&quot;, &quot;corrected&quot;), row.names = c(&quot;13&quot;, &quot;14&quot;, &quot;15&quot;, &quot;16&quot;,\r<br>&quot;17&quot;, &quot;18&quot;, &quot;19&quot;, &quot;20&quot;, &quot;21&quot;, &quot;22&quot;, &quot;23&quot;, &quot;24&quot;), class = &quot;data.frame&quot;)\r<br>\r<br># If you convert your data to &#39;long&#39; format and let shape and colour\r<br># be controlled by the column defining which records are Gross and which\r<br># are Corrected, then this becomes pretty straightforward:\r<br>\r<br>library(ggplot2)\r<br>library(reshape2)\r<br>vcm &lt;- melt(vc,id.vars=&#39;date&#39;)\r<br>vcm$variable &lt;- factor(vcm$variable,\r<br>                        levels=c(&#39;gross&#39;,&#39;corrected&#39;),\r<br>                        labels=c(&#39;Gross&#39;,&#39;Corrected&#39;))\r<br>\r<br># then, keeping most of your code as is and plotting vcm rather than vc,\r<br># and labelling modified lines (#CHANGED):\r<br>p &lt;- ggplot(vcm, aes(x=date,y=value))+\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "       scale_x_date(limits=as.Date(c(&quot;2016-12-31&quot;,&quot;2018-01-01&quot;)),\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "                    date_labels = &quot;%m/%y&quot;, date_minor_breaks=&quot;1 month&quot;) +\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "       scale_y_continuous(breaks=seq(-9,7,by=2)) +\r<br>       xlab(NULL) +\r<br>       ylab(&quot;Short-term changes (%)&quot;) +\r<br>       theme(panel.background= element_rect(fill=&quot;grey90&quot;),\r<br>             text = element_text(size=7),\r<br>             axis.ticks = element_line(size=0.1),\r<br>             panel.grid.major = element_line(size = 0.5,\r<br>                                             linetype = &#39;solid&#39;,\r<br>                                             colour = &quot;grey95&quot;),\r<br>             panel.grid.minor = element_line(size = 0.25,\r<br>                                             linetype = &#39;solid&#39;,\r<br>                                             colour = &quot;grey95&quot;)) +\r<br>             geom_hline(yintercept=0, color=&quot;brown&quot;,\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "                        size=0.5, linetype=&quot;solid&quot;) +\r<br>             theme(legend.position=&quot;bottom&quot;) +\r<br>             theme(legend.title = element_blank(), #CHANGED\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "                   legend.text = element_text(colour=&quot;black&quot;, size = 6,\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "                                              face = &quot;bold&quot;)) +\r<br>             #CHANGED next three lines\r<br>             geom_point(aes(colour=variable,shape=variable),size=1) +\r<br>             scale_colour_manual(values=c(&#39;blue&#39;,&#39;red&#39;)) +\r<br>             scale_shape_manual(values=c(3,16))\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>I think that does it.\r<br>\r<br>You could also have simplified the code to make it easier for people to\r<br>help you. In this case there is a lot that of theme stuff in particular\r<br>that does not relate to the specific question to be considered at and\r<br>could just have been left out.\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Ron."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
