     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks a lot Ron!<div>I&#39;m an absolute beginner with ggplot2 therefore your solution and above all your suggestions to make a better question are extremely valuable to me.</div><div>Thanks again and </div><div>Ciao from Rome</div><div>Vittorio </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
